Package: librarymetrics
Title: Analyzes Daily Library Usage Patterns
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Arthur", "Christoffersen", , "notarealone@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package takes a folder of CSV files that is independently generated by another fictional program and compares them, before constructing graphs to visualize usage patterns and indicating daily usage metrics. The files in question contain data representing usage metrics from a fictional library at the end of each business day. This allows for a quick way to measure benchmarks for the library.
Depends: R (<= 4.4.3), data.table (<= 1.17.0)
License: CC0
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
LazyData: true
